  "scope": "Complete unchanged AnalogTimePickerState/onTap/angle bodies with native Animatable, TargetBasedAnimation, AnimationState, SuspendAnimation, both animation-core and Foundation MutatorMutex, SpringSpec/FloatSpringSpec/vectorized spring/snap, Simulation and Estimation. Real CoroutineScope/Job/Mutex cancellation and Delay use deterministic JVM dispatcher/delay/frame platform hosts; plain scalar state and Float Dp/Saver/FocusRequester hosts. Annotation/platform expect bindings only are adapted. No native Compose snapshot/recomposition/node update/gesture dispatch/Android dispatcher/font/raster or decay paths."
